{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2023-05-02 11:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT LAUNCHES CYBERSECURITY PARTNERSHIP PROGRAM FOR MANAGED SECURITY SERVICE PROVIDERS', 'text': 'SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $KEYS #ATTK--KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: KEYS) LAUNCHES A NEW CYBERSECURITY PARTNERSHIP PROGRAM FOR MANAGED SECURITY SERVICE PROVIDERS (MSSP) TO IMPROVE THE SECURITY POSTURE OF ORGANIZATIONS USING THE INDUSTRY-LEADING BREACH AND ATTACK SIMULATION (BAS) CAPABILITIES OF KEYSIGHT THREAT SIMULATOR. CYBERATTACKS ARE ON THE RISE AND SO IS THE COST OF A DATA BREACH. IBM AND THE PONEMON INSTITUTE ESTIMATE THAT THE COST OF DATA BREACHES HAS REACHED AN ALL-TIME HIGH GLOBALL.'}